  "source": "## Semantics: D1, D2, B5, B3, M0, A1\ngrammar ConformanceTable version \"1.0.0\" mode \"v1\" {\n  ## A stage abbreviation resolved through the stages table.\n  main = alt from_table \"stages\" column \"abbr\" as abbr\n\n  preprocess resolve {\n    table_lookup stages abbr -> code\n  }\n\n  bindings main {\n    abbr -> code (string) preprocess: resolve\n  }\n\n  entry main: main\n\n  test main {\n    accept \"DIS\"\n    accept \"IS\"\n    reject \"XX\"\n    # example-level assertions on the preprocessed binding are gated on\n    # the native preprocess row lookup (parsanol-rs: embedded table rows\n    # are not reachable from the native bind path yet)\n  }\n}\n",
